# Gitignored artifacts a fresh worktree needs before it can build.
#
# A worktree at another commit is how you find out whether a regression is
# yours or was already there, so it has to be cheap to make. Everything else
# under .cache/ is fetched by tools/prepare_dependencies.py, which clones the
# PocketJS upstream and bmi270 at their pinned revisions in about a minute.
# The Rust archives are the exception: tools/build_native.sh cross-compiles
# them for xtensa under WSL, which is tens of minutes, and the output does not
# depend on anything in this repository. Copying them is always correct.
.cache/native/
